    "text": "21 hours ago ⚠️ Public budget workshop on Sept. 28\nNew Garden Township will hold a General Fund budget workshop on Monday, September 28, 2026 at 7:00 p.m.\nThe meeting is open to the public and will take place at the Township Building . It will also be livestreamed on YouTube so you can watch from home.\nYou can join online at the township’s YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@NewGardenTownship/streams .\nIf you care about how the township plans to spend its General Fund money next year, this is a good chance to listen in and see what’s being discussed.\nMore Info: BOS Budget Meeting - 9/28/2026 • New Garden Townsh...\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
